    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the Shooting phase of your opponent's turn or in either player's Fight phase, the moment an enemy unit wipes out a DIRE AVENGERS unit or a GUARDIANS unit of yours. Pick one of your WAR WALKERS units. Once the enemy unit's attacks are all resolved, your WAR WALKERS unit may shoot as in your own Shooting phase, but only at that enemy unit, which must be a valid target for it. Usable just once per battle round.",
